B.a2x=new A.dP("Type what the receipt shows, top to bottom. The app works out the tax and the total; you only enter the parts.",null)
B.a2M=new A.dP("Receipt: the amounts you type are before tax, and tax is added at the rate for each category and the place you shopped.",null)
B.a2I=new A.dP("Bank: the amounts come off a statement, with the tax already inside them, so nothing is added. The choice stays put between expenses, for working through a statement.",null)
B.Nc=s([B.a2M,B.a2I],t.p)
B.a35=new A.ji("From",B.Nc,null)
B.a2z=new A.dP("The date starts as today, already selected, so you can type over it. Pick the store from the list, or tap one of the recent stores under the field.",null)
B.M1=s([B.a2z],t.p)
B.a3a=new A.ji("Date and store",B.M1,null)
B.a2B=new A.dP("Pick the main category: the one most of the receipt is, like Groceries. The list puts the categories you use most at this store first, then the ones you use most anywhere.",null)
B.a2O=new A.dP("Type the subtotal printed on the receipt, before tax. If the whole receipt is one category, that is all: two entries, however long the receipt.",null)
B.KO=s([B.a2B,B.a2O],t.p)
B.a37=new A.ji("Receipt subtotal and main category",B.KO,null)
B.a2v=new A.dP('For anything that is not the main category, type a line: a few letters of its category, then its price. "ho 12.99" is Household. The main category gets the rest of the subtotal automatically, so you never add anything up.',null)
B.a2N=new A.dP("A line without letters stays in the category of the line above, so you only type letters when the category changes. Press Enter for the next line, and Enter on an empty line to finish. Backspace on an empty line removes it.",null)
B.a2u=new A.dP('Rebates and instant savings: type a minus, like "-3.00", on the line under the item it came off. It counts against that item\'s category. A rebate on a main-category item needs no line at all, because the subtotal already includes it.',null)
B.a2y=new A.dP('The letters only pick a category when exactly one name starts with them. If they could mean two, like "g" for Gas or Groceries, the line says so and waits for another letter. The shortest letters for your usual categories are listed under the lines.',null)
B.a2F=new A.dP("No subtotal? Type every line instead; lines without letters at the top go to the main category, and each category is added up for you.",null)
B.MC=s([B.a2v,B.a2N,B.a2u,B.a2y,B.a2F],t.p)
B.a32=new A.ji("Lines in other categories",B.MC,null)
B.a2A=new A.dP("Under the lines, each category shows its amount before tax, its tax and its total, with the whole receipt's total last. Compare that total with the receipt: if they differ, a price was missed or mistyped.",null)
B.Lz=s([B.a2A],t.p)
B.a33=new A.ji("Totals",B.Lz,null)
B.a2K=new A.dP("Amounts fill from the cents up, like a till: typing 1, 5, 0 gives 1.50. There is no need to type the decimal point. A minus sign makes a refund.",null)
B.Mt=s([B.a2K],t.p)
B.a36=new A.ji("Typing amounts",B.Mt,null)
B.a2L=new A.dP("Where you shopped, which decides the sales-tax rate. It starts as the store's usual place, or your home. Start typing a city to choose another.",null)
B.LY=s([B.a2L],t.p)
B.a34=new A.ji("Location",B.LY,null)
B.a2C=new A.dP('Save expense shows the receipt as it will be stored, under "Does this match your receipt?". If an amount or the tax differs from the paper, correct it there: the receipt wins.',null)
B.a2H=new A.dP("Save & New files it and clears the form for the next receipt. Save & Home files it and goes back to the home screen. Back returns to the form without saving.",null)
B.a2w=new A.dP("If something would stop the expense from saving, it is said beside the Save expense button while you type.",null)
B.LP=s([B.a2C,B.a2H,B.a2w],t.p)
B.a38=new A.ji("Saving",B.LP,null)
B.a2D=new A.dP("Everything works without a mouse. Enter moves to the next field in the order a receipt is read: date, store, subtotal, main category, each line, and finally the note.",null)
B.a2G=new A.dP("Enter in the note moves to Save expense, which shows a ring around it. Press Enter again to save. The check that follows opens with Save & New selected, so one more Enter files the expense and puts you back on the date of a fresh form.",null)
B.a2E=new A.dP("Tab and Shift+Tab move between fields and buttons, including the corrections in the check. Space or Enter presses a selected button. F1 opens this page.",null)
B.a2J=new A.dP("Hold Shift and use the arrow keys to jump to the nearest field in that direction: Shift+Up from the store goes back to the date, and Shift+Down from the subtotal goes to the main category and then the lines.",null)
B.LJ=s([B.a2D,B.a2G,B.a2E,B.a2J],t.p)
B.a39=new A.ji("Keyboard",B.LJ,null)
